{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28709","headline":"宣城赠萧兵曹 · 杜牧","name":"宣城赠萧兵曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂檝谪湘渚，三年波上春。\n舟寒句溪雪，衣故洛城尘。\n客道耻摇尾，皇恩宽犯鳞。\n花时去国远，月夕上楼频。\n赊酒不辞病，佣书非爲贫。\n行吟值渔父，坐隐对樵人。\n紫陌罢双辙，碧潭穷一纶。\n高秋更南去，烟水是通津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}